runs about 354 s (6 DPM++ SDE steps x 2 CFG passes of the 1024x1024 SDXL UNet, then the VAE), past test-run.ps1's fixed 60 s wall budget; run by hand: tools/codex-vm.exe -kernel <cdx> -output <out> -mem 3072 -headless -disk <minted bpe disk> -gpu-files build-output/diffusion-models -gpu-out build-output
